 across several solid tumors, which is in preclinical trials. It is also developing T-cell engager programs. The company has collaborations with TerSera Therapeutics LLC; Incyte Corporation; and Gilead Sciences, Inc. MacroGenics, Inc. was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Rockville, Maryland."}}